docs/agent-context/codex-loop-context-management-issues.md:20:- **U3**: As an agent, I receive deterministic issue, stage, Git, and retry context inside the Agent Prompt.
docs/agent-context/codex-loop-context-management-issues.md:98:- [ ] Validate invalid stage context config as a Readiness Gap before dispatch.
docs/agent-context/codex-loop-context-management-issues.md:112:Extend the built-in Agent Context Snapshot so retry launches include bounded context from the previous failed attempt. The retry context should help the next agent continue without storing or replaying the full transcript.
docs/agent-context/codex-loop-context-management-issues.md:116:- [ ] Include previous attempt number and a bounded stdout/stderr tail when launching a retry.
docs/agent-context/codex-loop-context-management-issues.md:117:- [ ] Keep retry output out of the snapshot on first launch.
docs/agent-context/codex-loop-context-management-issues.md:118:- [ ] Truncate retry output deterministically with a clear truncation marker.
docs/agent-context/codex-loop-context-management-issues.md:120:- [ ] Add backend tests for first launch, retry launch, stdout/stderr truncation, and prompt ordering with Stage Goal Handoff enabled.
docs/agent-context/codex-loop-context-management-issues.md:135:- [ ] Reject invalid command config as a Readiness Gap before dispatch.
docs/agent-context/codex-loop-context-management-issues.md:139:- [ ] Convert timeout, missing executable, non-zero exit, and oversized stdout into bounded warning content without moving the task to retry by themselves.
docs/agent-context/codex-loop-context-management-issues.md:154:- [ ] Runtime State includes context status for running and retrying tasks: skipped, succeeded, warning, timed out, or failed.
docs/agent-context/codex-loop-context-management-issues.md:158:- [ ] The Web Dashboard shows context status per running or retrying task without replacing Goal Usage, task status, or readiness summaries.
docs/agent-context/codex-loop-context-management-issues.md:196:- [ ] Document failure behavior: context warnings do not retry tasks by themselves.
docs/agent-context/codex-loop-context-management-issues.md:217:- [ ] Decide whether failed review retries the task, moves it to a Human Attention Status, or adds reviewer guidance to the next attempt.
